SUMMARY:Atheist chat at the Whole Foods cafe on South Tunnel Road
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Atheists\nPlease visit with us **Sunday Sept 20** to
  chat with like-minded people. We're meeting **once a month on Sunday morn
 ings**. Mark your calendar for **Sept 20 and October 18.**\n(If you *think
 * you might come\, please mark **Attend** below\; that helps us know how m
 any tables to put together.)\n\nOur great new location is **the cafe upsta
 irs** at **Whole Foods\, 4 South Tunnel Road (across from the mall).** The
 y have coffee and a lot more. Maybe you have shopping you want to do at Wh
 ole Foods or one of the other businesses on Tunnel Road.\n\n**We start at 
 10am and end at noon**\, but you're welcome to arrive or leave according t
 o your own schedule.\n\nIf some folks want to have serious conversations a
 bout religion and/or atheism\, while others just want to chat about other 
 things\, we'll use two sets of tables.\n\n**We hope *you* stop by**. You c
 an also feel free to tell other non-believers about our meetups - they are
  welcome too.\n\nIf you have other dates\, times\, locations or activities
  to suggest for the future\, please email them to peterthorwarth@gmail.com
  Thanks!
